      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name}\n\nWe have identified the cause. The SDK is working properly, and it appears to be a compatibility issue that occurs when ModularAvatar (1.9.15) is installed in SDK3.7.0 in a project that contains multibyte characters in the folder path.\n\nThis is probably an issue that should be addressed by the tool creator, not VRChat. We apologize for the inconvenience.",
